                                "sense_id": "d79694f1-06e2-3fb1-ab2e-59780c0c0c7f",
                                "text": "The agriculturists are a scattered generation — the upper ranks of them proud as Lucifer, on their little dunghills; and the lower, I mean in England, in a brutal state of mental obfuscity."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a93888be-916c-43f8-b271-0236e861078c",
                                "sense_id": "d79694f1-06e2-3fb1-ab2e-59780c0c0c7f",
                                "text": "While the distant wolf\nHowls\nHis obfuscity to the stars"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f3017935-e60d-465a-af2a-0f61b6414533",
                                "sense_id": "d79694f1-06e2-3fb1-ab2e-59780c0c0c7f",
                                "text": "Thomas Bauer meanwhile posits a reading of the Qur'anic mubin as a comment on the deliberate stylistic obfuscity of pre-Islamic poetry."
